exports[`SubscriptionStartedEmail > matches the plain text body 1`] = `
"WELCOME TO
PENCIL CASE PRO

Your pencil case PRO subscription is active and all paid features are switched on. Thanks a lot for supporting us!

Creem, our payment partner, sends your receipt and invoice in a separate email. Their customer portal is also where you manage your payment method and subscription — you can reach it any time from the upgrade page."
`;

